From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 04:25:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Read packed node storage through accessors

Follow blitz-dom's packed node storage: links are slot indexes, a node's id comes from
id(), special data from the element's rare box, and border, padding and scrollbar sizes
from a layout that may keep them out of line. Paint output is unchanged.
